      "decodingStatus": "partial",
      "transforms": [
        {
          "name": "decodeIndirectIrradiance",
          "expression": "E = View.OneOverPreExposure * (exp2(16*GBufferC.a - 8) - 2^-8)",
          "requires": [
            "GBufferC",
            "View.OneOverPreExposure"
          ],
          "sourceRefs": [
            "part0.DSC_inddec",
            "part0.DSC_oneover"
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "decodeBaseColor",
          "expression": "BaseColor = sRGBToLinear(GBufferC.rgb)",
          "requires": [
            "GBufferC"
          ],
          "sourceRefs": [
            "part0.DSC_baseenc",
            "part0.DSC_basesrgb"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "mathTerms": [
        "EncodeIndirectIrradiance: log2(E*View.PreExposure + 2^-8)/16 + 0.5 + bias/255"
      ],
      "producerSources": [
        "part0.BasePass_enc",
        "part0.DSC_ca",
        "part0.DSC_cb",
        "part0.DSC_cc"
      ],
      "consumerSources": [
        "part0.DSC_decbase",
        "part0.DSC_inddec"
      ],
      "gaps": [
        "Alpha semantic is a runtime permutation: GBUFFER_HAS_DIFFUSE_SAMPLE_OCCLUSION is 0 by default (r.GBufferDiffuseSampleOcclusion=0, RenderUtils.cpp:747-750); ALLOW_STATIC_LIGHTING selects indirect irradiance, otherwise AO.",
        "QuantizationBias (+/-0.5 LSB) is added in BasePassPixelShader.usf:2366/2379 and is not recoverable from the stored byte alone.",
        "High-precision permutation uses PF_FloatRGBA and different packing; Substrate bypasses this path."
      ],
      "fields": [
        {
          "name": "BaseColorR",
          "type": "unorm8",
          "decode": "hardware sRGB->linear decode of memory byte 2 (shader .r)",
          "units": "linear color",
          "sourceRefs": [
